            name="BeamSetPlan"
            description="This represents a set of intended controls of the behavior of the sensor’s beam sets. It describes a repeated series of time intervals (TimeRepetition), bounded by a start time and duration (TimeInterval). The BeamSet used during each time interval can be selected by cycling through the list of BeamSets. Each BeamSet can be used for transmit, receive, or both, depending on other controls."
