          name="SosaSpec"
          description="SosaSpec Views provide a mechanism to assign baseline logical and platform representations for each SOSA entity outside of any formalized SOSA interface message view.  These are used to generate full Div1 &amp; Div2 change proposals without the need to generate Div3.  There should be a single SosaSpec View for each entity."
