                name="Quaternion_A_MSA"
                description="This axis represents the scalar (real) component of the quaternion. It is often associated with magnitude or the cosine of half the rotation angle in 3D rotations.&#10;&#10;Although this dimension may be expressed in radians or degrees since it represents the cosine of half of the angle, it is considered to be dimensionless."/>
