                name="AbstractDiscreteSetMeasurementSystem"
                description="A template MeasurementSystem referenced by all Measurements whose value is one of a set of selected discrete states (e.g., enumerations and multi-state variables). The Measurement must specify the real state set in its MeasurementAxis discrete set."
