                xmi:id="EAID_A60E666A_2E05_4c81_A7CB_BDE7B7C3A189"
                name="Abstract_DiscreteSet_MeasSysAxis"
                description="This is the Measurement System Axis (MSA) for the AbstractDiscreteSetMeasurementSystem.  Although there is no appropriate default set of enumeration values, a default value type unit (VTU) must be assigned to this MSA to fulfill the metamodel requirements.  Thus, a VTU with a single, &quot;dummy&quot; state has been defined.  When a user implements an enumeration measurement using the AbstractDiscreteSetMeasurementSystem, they must define a VTU with an appropriate set of enumeration values.  This VTU will then override the default VTU when it is assigned to the Measurement Axis (MA) that connects the Measurement with this MSA."/>
          </ldm>
